Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.33,0:00:11.37,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Yo! Yo, yo! Are you, like, awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:13.05,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,SQ...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.05,0:00:14.18,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Can you stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.69,0:00:18.03,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I'm back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.03,0:00:19.71,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Hm? What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.71,0:00:21.39,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Er, nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:23.90,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, SQ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:30.91,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Hm? Setsu said I should come and get you, \Nsince we're both Guard Duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.43,0:00:33.13,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Both Guard Duty...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.13,0:00:38.23,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Yup! We didn't leave the ship at Liu-An \Nduring the whole Gnosia mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.63,0:00:40.58,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,You and cute li'l SQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.53,0:02:16.95,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}EPISODE 11: 511
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.02,0:02:17.07,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}This probably means there'll be \Nnew information here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.07,0:02:18.98,Default,REMNAN,0,0,0,,No! Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.98,0:02:21.72,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Why? You know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:25.08,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,It's because I love you, Remmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.79,0:02:30.59,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:32.50,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:34.11,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.11,0:02:36.78,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I was just thinking they were \Nreally pretty... your nails.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.78,0:02:38.84,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Oooh! I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.84,0:02:42.10,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,You've done well to notice, my good sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.10,0:02:45.28,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,So... who else is on board?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.28,0:02:51.86,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Huh? Um... There's you, me, Setsu, Remmy...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.15,0:02:57.37,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jonas, Kukrushka, Chipie, \NShigemichi, and Yuriko.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.66,0:02:58.86,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nine of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.61,0:03:01.62,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Two Gnosia have been detected,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.14,0:03:05.63,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}and there is one each of the Engineer, \NDoctor, and Guardian Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.63,0:03:08.85,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Furthermore, as Yuri and SQ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.85,0:03:13.93,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}remained on the ship as Guard Duty, \Nit is confirmed that they are human.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.90,0:03:17.43,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,All right. Let's start the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.80,0:03:20.44,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kukrushka and Jonas...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.44,0:03:23.64,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,Why do you know about Kukrushka?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:25.98,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,I don't recall ever letting you meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.98,0:03:28.33,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Since Kukrushka is here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.33,0:03:32.82,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should be able to ask Jonas about her \Nwithout him getting suspicious like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.27,0:03:34.23,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:36.23,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}What should I ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.74,0:03:38.83,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was told there were two of her...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.37,0:03:43.01,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}But does that mean this one is a doll, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.36,0:03:43.99,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,First...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.42,0:03:47.66,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,If you have Engineer credentials, \Nmake yourself known.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.66,0:03:50.26,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,And do your sworn duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.50,0:03:55.45,Default,SHIGEMICHI,0,0,0,,I'm the Engineer, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.45,0:03:58.76,Default,SHIGEMICHI,0,0,0,,I'll check out someone tonight \Nto see if they're a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.20,0:04:00.51,Default,REMNAN,0,0,0,,W-Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:03.02,Default,REMNAN,0,0,0,,I'm the Engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.45,0:04:05.03,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,So there's two of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.56,0:04:07.64,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,And what about the Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.05,0:04:11.52,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,No response, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:14.91,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,They do say that the deeper the river, \Nthe more silent it flows...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.91,0:04:20.41,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,The Doctor is only able to use their ability \Nafter someone is put into cold sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.41,0:04:23.41,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be in their interest \Nto declare themselves right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.73,0:04:27.83,Default,YURIKO,0,0,0,,It appears as though this is all of the \Ninformation we can currently obtain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.59,0:04:31.33,Default,YURIKO,0,0,0,,Now, how shall we proceed \Nwith the festivities?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.84,0:04:36.35,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,Well, why don't we ask the two \Nconfirmed humans what they think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:39.34,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,There's not much I can say...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:44.22,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,But it's dangerous to freeze the Engineers \Nbefore we hear their reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.22,0:04:45.60,Default,SHIGEMICHI,0,0,0,,Meaning...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.04,0:04:50.74,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,We'll be choosing from the remaining five \Nafter excluding the Engineers and Guard Duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:55.76,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is difficult. We can't clearly tell \Nanyone's suspicious with what we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.76,0:04:57.99,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}The votes will probably be divided.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.03,0:05:06.54,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kukrushka...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.85,0:05:15.07,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,Ah... Even frozen, her beauty \Nremains unchanged.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.07,0:05:18.05,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,As though it's been sealed \Nin ice forevermore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.43,0:05:19.67,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, that's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.67,0:05:22.55,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now that Kukrushka's been \Nput into cold sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.55,0:05:26.13,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't be able to ask Jonas \Nabout her in this loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.05,0:05:34.06,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}The more I loop, the more \Nthings I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.57,0:05:37.57,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuriko is definitely hiding something...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.57,0:05:41.06,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}and I don't know why Kukrushka, \Nwho's a doll, did what she did,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.06,0:05:43.57,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}or why Remnan is always cowering in fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:45.93,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I still don't know any of those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.81,0:05:54.50,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right now, I'm just going to have \Nto work hard to fill this thing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.71,0:05:58.24,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Yay, it's lovely Yuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.24,0:05:59.35,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,SQ...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.35,0:06:01.75,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Ooh, what's that thing? It's pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:03.83,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.83,0:06:06.76,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,It's almost time for the warp...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:09.23,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.23,0:06:13.15,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,But I thought we should have a \Nlittle chat before that, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:18.15,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,So, you and I have been, like, \Nconfirmed as humans, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.15,0:06:22.22,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,That means we're soulmates that \Ndon't have to suspect each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.81,0:06:27.33,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I see... This is the first time SQ \Nand I have been on Guard Duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.33,0:06:30.66,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Does this mean the information \NI'm supposed to find could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.66,0:06:34.22,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,What? Am I not good enough \Nto be your soulmate?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.63,0:06:37.37,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Then... should we see how \Nfar we can take this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:39.28,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh? No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.77,0:06:42.85,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.85,0:06:46.93,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I'm going to get information about SQ, \NI need to be friendlier to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.20,0:06:49.94,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah! Let's take this as far as we can go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.15,0:06:51.09,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:53.44,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh? Did I say something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.89,0:06:56.27,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Your eyes are a bit scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.27,0:06:58.64,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,I was just kidding, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.64,0:07:02.19,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you to be, like, \Nso gung-ho, Yurinchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.89,0:07:09.32,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Yeah, never mind. See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.79,0:07:14.73,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Argh! I'm such an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:17.87,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,What the heck was I saying?! \NOf course she was kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.87,0:07:20.47,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,How many times have \NI talked to SQ before?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.47,0:07:25.59,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right. SQ is always \Njoking around like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:27.48,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no way she'd be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.79,0:07:30.47,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Ah, Chipie. Have you seen SQ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.47,0:07:33.01,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did. I think she went...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.13,0:07:36.20,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}The shower room...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.20,0:07:38.16,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,This place again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.56,0:07:42.82,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,SQ? SQ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:44.70,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.99,0:07:46.59,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Huh? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.59,0:07:49.66,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,No! Wait! You've got the wrong idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.66,0:07:51.49,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.12,0:07:55.34,Default,SHIGEMICHI,0,0,0,,What? You interested in my bod, bud?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.74,0:07:56.93,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Yeah, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.45,0:07:58.96,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.96,0:08:02.88,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Did you actually come \Nlooking for cute li'l SQ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:04.99,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.99,0:08:07.09,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Really? Why, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.57,0:08:12.72,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Er, well, you came to talk to me, \Nand I ended up saying something weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.10,0:08:14.38,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,So I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.95,0:08:23.99,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,So, who do you think is a Gnosia, Yurinchy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.22,0:08:25.69,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.69,0:08:29.66,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Honestly, I think it's a bit \Ndifficult to narrow it down yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.66,0:08:30.74,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,How about you, SQ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.37,0:08:33.33,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Oh, I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.54,0:08:39.09,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,But out of the two Engineers, \NI think Shigemichi's a li'l more sus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.09,0:08:40.17,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.48,0:08:44.59,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Well, I don't think Remmy's \Nable to lie that boldly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.59,0:08:47.58,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,If he did, I think it'd \Nshow more on his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.00,0:08:49.43,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,It's all about love, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.68,0:08:56.44,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,That face... I guess you do remember, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.34,0:08:58.43,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.79,0:09:00.44,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Hm? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.90,0:09:05.45,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Is Remnan... your papa, SQ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.84,0:09:08.20,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,"Papa"? What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.20,0:09:10.94,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Er, nothing. Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.94,0:09:13.66,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Right. You want to know \Nwho I think is suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.66,0:09:15.84,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Jonas is sticking out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.84,0:09:16.98,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.45,0:09:19.24,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Yuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.77,0:09:21.59,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,You're hiding something, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.97,0:09:22.84,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:26.79,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,You know way too much for an amnesiac.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.33,0:09:31.73,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,You can't fool {\i1}my{\i0} nose, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.73,0:09:33.76,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Y-You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.04,0:09:37.02,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Anyway, if you don't wanna \Ntell me, you don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.39,0:09:41.52,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Who knows? We might end up \Ndisappearing either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:42.76,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:44.04,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if I try to play it off,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.04,0:09:47.19,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't think I have the \Nacting skills to fully commit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.62,0:09:58.59,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,So you've collected all this knowledge \Nthroughout your loops, Yurinchy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.59,0:09:59.89,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:03.85,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,So there's probably more \Ninformation and knowledge
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.85,0:10:06.60,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,that I don't know about \Neveryone on this world line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.37,0:10:12.73,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Ah, so that must be why you \Ncame to ask me about Remmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.73,0:10:13.60,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:15.72,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorta...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:17.29,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.29,0:10:22.47,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Well, I can't blame you. \NIt can be hard to tell what's a joke or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.90,0:10:26.70,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,I guess no one would try to get close \Nto me without a reason like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.70,0:10:27.73,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.07,0:10:32.72,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Okay! Then let me fill \Nyou in on cute li'l SQ!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.72,0:10:35.75,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,You seemed to be on the right \Ntrack about Remmy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.75,0:10:37.00,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.31,0:10:39.50,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,You seem happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.96,0:10:43.42,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Well, yeah. I've been curious \Nthis whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.39,0:10:50.44,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Okay, time for an SQ quiz! \NFirst question, ba-bam!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.15,0:10:55.67,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Why is my name "SQ"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.67,0:10:58.12,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh? SQ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.12,0:11:00.18,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Is the S short for something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.71,0:11:03.57,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Um, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.57,0:11:07.52,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Tick tock, tick tock...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.52,0:11:10.73,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Bzzt! Yurinchy is out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:12.85,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,You won't be going to the next stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.85,0:11:14.33,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.33,0:11:15.90,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.99,0:11:19.59,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Let's start counting \Nalphabetically from A, B, C...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.07,0:11:21.96,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,all the way to Z.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.36,0:11:23.95,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,After that,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.36,0:11:29.80,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,if we kept counting using \NAA, AB, AC, and so on,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.80,0:11:32.42,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,what number would SQ be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.42,0:11:36.46,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Um... There are 26 letters in the alphabet...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:37.87,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.87,0:11:40.22,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,It's 511.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.59,0:11:43.97,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Meaning cute li'l SQ over here is a spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.76,0:11:47.74,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,The 511th created.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.03,0:11:54.27,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,A spare...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.27,0:11:56.53,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Yep. More precisely...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.53,0:11:59.05,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,My mama... Oh, her name is Manan...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.05,0:12:04.30,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,I'm the 511th new body for her to use \Nso that she can be young again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.60,0:12:06.30,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.76,0:12:09.29,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,So you're not... human?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.63,0:12:14.80,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,It's really hard to define what \Nis human and what isn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.80,0:12:19.30,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,but if anything artificially created is out, \Nthen I guess I'm not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.15,0:12:25.89,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,I lived in an incubation pod \Never since I was born,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:28.79,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,an empty vessel without a consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.28,0:12:34.31,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,But when Mama tried to transfer her \Nown consciousness across...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.31,0:12:39.34,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,For some reason, the spare body had, like, \Ndeveloped its own consciousness somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.83,0:12:42.07,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,So Mama's transfer failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.41,0:12:43.87,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,The spare was left with, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.87,0:12:48.26,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,its own newly born consciousness mixed \Nwith bits and pieces of Mama's memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.26,0:12:52.83,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Combine all that together into one \Nhalf-baked existence, and what do you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.83,0:12:55.35,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,This cute li'l SQ right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.56,0:12:58.59,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,So when you said you were \Nonly one year old...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.59,0:12:59.66,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.32,0:13:01.77,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.09,0:13:05.34,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,That's something I told you \Nin another world line, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.34,0:13:08.78,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,But thou speakest the truth! \NNo falsehoods detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.09,0:13:11.66,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,I mean, just look how flawless my skin is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.66,0:13:17.02,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,You said that, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.27,0:13:22.03,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Hm, you're making this difficult. \NIt's like you know everything about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.03,0:13:26.54,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,That's not true. This is the \Nfirst time I'm hearing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.95,0:13:29.29,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.85,0:13:32.45,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm just a spare body, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.45,0:13:37.72,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,A failed experiment that lied its way \Ninto pretending to be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.72,0:13:41.56,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,I doubt I'd wanna talk \Nabout that in any world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.54,0:13:43.80,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:45.69,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Hey, no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.48,0:13:49.74,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is almost time for the warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.74,0:13:51.36,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please return to your rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.08,0:13:56.11,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Whoopsies. Looks like it's about that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.68,0:13:58.98,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Well? How's the Silver Key doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:13:59.87,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:07.78,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,So all that's knowledge?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.78,0:14:08.55,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.26,0:14:10.57,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Well, I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.57,0:14:13.87,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,I'm glad that knowledge from a phony \Nlike me was still able to help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.41,0:14:15.66,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.66,0:14:17.53,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Depending on the loop,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.53,0:14:21.13,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,you probably met some SQs \Nwhere Mama's transfer succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.51,0:14:24.89,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,That might've been what Remmy was scared of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.33,0:14:26.65,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Scared of?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.62,0:14:31.89,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,So, like, some of Mama's \Nmemories are still in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.27,0:14:37.89,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,And a lot of them are, like, \Nsuper intense and gory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.89,0:14:42.78,Default,REMNAN,0,0,0,,I used to be someone \Nelse's property. Someone's pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.03,0:14:45.75,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}So the one who owned Remnan was...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.28,0:14:47.67,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Wait. "Papa"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.99,0:14:50.16,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,SQ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.02,0:14:52.60,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I guess she left...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.97,0:15:08.31,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I... I feel like I did something \NI really shouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.31,0:15:11.63,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is almost time for the warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.63,0:15:14.31,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuri, please return to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.59,0:15:17.82,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I focused too much on just \Ngathering new information!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.27,0:15:23.80,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuri, for your safety, \Nplease return to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.61,0:15:27.68,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Warp commencing in five,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.68,0:15:31.87,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}four, three, two, one...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.88,0:15:36.80,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,S...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.59,0:15:49.31,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.02,0:15:53.18,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.18,0:15:54.66,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,SQ...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.66,0:15:57.01,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,LeVi! Do you sense SQ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.27,0:15:59.99,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I do indeed sense SQ's presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.38,0:16:02.01,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.40,0:16:06.63,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Yuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.54,0:16:09.74,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,SQ! I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.10,0:16:12.89,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,What's this? Why so serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.89,0:16:15.75,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Are you about to confess \Nyour feelings to cute li'l SQ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.07,0:16:17.75,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,No, that's not it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.14,0:16:22.47,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, the meeting's about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.47,0:16:26.07,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Ms. LeVi's super strict, \Nso we can't be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.21,0:16:39.69,Default,YURIKO,0,0,0,,So Jonas has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.53,0:16:46.96,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Okay, then I'll start things off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.96,0:16:50.95,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,I'm the Doctor. Is anyone \Nelse going to claim that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.86,0:16:55.20,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,I figured as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:56.96,Default,SHIGEMICHI,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.29,0:17:01.21,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,I investigated Kukrushka, who was \Nsent into cold sleep yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.21,0:17:03.70,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,She was a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.20,0:17:04.96,Default,YURIKO,0,0,0,,Oho...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.61,0:17:09.55,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,So that's why no one else \Nclaimed Doctor besides me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.55,0:17:12.47,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Because there's only one more Gnosia left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.81,0:17:17.76,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,I see. And since he already proclaimed \Nhimself the Engineer yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.76,0:17:19.48,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,he can't claim he's also the Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.48,0:17:26.38,Default,REMNAN,0,0,0,,So... That means that the last remaining \NGnosia is either Shigemichi or me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.91,0:17:28.67,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,That is indeed what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.01,0:17:31.90,Default,SHIGEMICHI,0,0,0,,W-Wait. That's not the only possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.90,0:17:33.66,Default,YURIKO,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.97,0:17:37.41,Default,YURIKO,0,0,0,,It could be that Kukrushka, \Nwho was frozen the first day,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.41,0:17:40.37,Default,YURIKO,0,0,0,,was the real Doctor, and Setsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.37,0:17:43.55,Default,YURIKO,0,0,0,,You might be a Gnosia \Npretending to be the Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.83,0:17:46.30,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,I see. I guess that's also a possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.58,0:17:47.80,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Man, what a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.80,0:17:50.36,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuriko does have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.36,0:17:51.30,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.80,0:17:57.92,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,If either SQ or I disappear, I won't be able \Nto talk to her in this world line anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:02.18,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Yuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.11,0:18:06.65,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I can't deny that what Yuriko \Ndescribed is a possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.65,0:18:12.41,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,But... Let's say that Setsu is the real \NDoctor and Kukrushka was a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.68,0:18:15.16,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,That would mean our victory \Nhas already been decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.47,0:18:17.17,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,Huh? Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.17,0:18:19.88,Default,YUR,0,0,0,,LeVi, show us yesterday's voting results.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.88,0:18:21.42,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Displaying now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.28,0:18:30.60,Default,YURIKO,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.96,0:18:33.75,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Shigemichi and Kukrushka voted for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.05,0:18:36.13,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Remnan voted for Kukrushka.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.96,0:18:40.98,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,There's no way a Gnosia would \Nvote for another Gnosia here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.98,0:18:44.32,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Which confirms that Remnan is human and...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.32,0:18:46.07,Default,SHIGEMICHI,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.07,0:18:50.24,Default,SHIGEMICHI,0,0,0,,It could just as easily be the opposite! \NWhat if Setsu and Remnan are the Gnosia?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.24,0:18:53.66,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,True, that possibility isn't zero. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.66,0:18:57.74,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Setsu voted for Yuriko, \Nand Remnan voted for Kukrushka.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.01,0:19:00.50,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,If Setsu and Remnan were both Gnosia,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.50,0:19:04.00,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,they most likely would have voted \Nfor the same person on the first day,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:07.75,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,when the votes were most easily divided, \Nto minimize the chance of being voted out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.15,0:19:10.01,Default,SHIGEMICHI,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.35,0:19:13.62,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I believe that you are the remaining Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.65,0:19:17.52,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is almost time for voting to commence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.86,0:19:37.29,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Gnosia presence has been eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:40.05,Default,REMNAN,0,0,0,,So we... survived?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.05,0:19:41.17,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.93,0:19:43.04,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Right-o.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:46.82,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Then let's feast until we can feast no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.82,0:19:47.54,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,SQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.45,0:19:50.68,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,SQ!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.61,0:19:54.87,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,SQ!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.44,0:19:56.82,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,SQ!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.57,0:20:09.56,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,This is a hologram...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.86,0:20:29.38,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,You forgot this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.52,0:20:36.34,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you knew which was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.06,0:20:38.23,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.65,0:20:42.97,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Jeez, you don't need to apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.84,0:20:48.85,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I wish I had a better idea of what to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.85,0:20:52.82,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,But all I can really do \Nis tell you how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.73,0:20:55.48,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.99,0:20:58.33,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,There's something I really \Nwanted to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.37,0:21:02.61,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,You're not some failed experiment or lie, SQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.53,0:21:05.51,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,You're not just some spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.60,0:21:11.00,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Hmm, I appreciate the thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.37,0:21:14.81,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,but the truth is what it is, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.81,0:21:18.01,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,In reality, cute li'l SQ \Nis indeed just another spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.30,0:21:23.01,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,But I was able to find you \Nout of all these clones, SQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.32,0:21:25.01,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,You're {\i1}not{\i0} just some spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.39,0:21:31.46,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I've met you many, many times \Nacross many, many loops.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.26,0:21:35.78,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,To me, you're not just a spare. You're SQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.16,0:21:39.79,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,You're not the fake to \Nyour mother's original.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.48,0:21:43.39,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,You're the original you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.22,0:21:47.40,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Oh? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.40,0:21:49.04,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Did you fall for cute li'l SQ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:54.96,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,I dunno, though. Yurinchy, \Nyou're a bit too serious for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.45,0:21:59.84,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I'm glad I got to know more about you, SQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.60,0:22:05.40,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Because you always tried to \Nhide yourself behind the lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.27,0:22:11.45,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I finally got to meet the real you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.33,0:22:16.99,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I was able to catch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.57,0:22:28.12,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,You're about to loop, aren't you, Yurinchy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.37,0:22:31.67,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,You're gonna meet all kinds of SQs,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.67,0:22:35.00,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,including ones where Mama's \Ntransfer succeeded, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.89,0:22:38.11,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Then lemme just give you a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.98,0:22:43.20,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Ready? Never ever trust cute li'l SQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.05,0:22:47.85,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,She... Manan is a natural-born liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.18,0:22:52.92,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,So make sure you don't fall
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.20,0:22:57.19,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,for a liar like me again, 'kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.12,0:23:00.57,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,SQ...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.16,0:23:03.39,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,But also...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.00,0:23:07.99,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,I hope you don't ever forget \NTHIS cute li'l SQ right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.33,0:23:13.49,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Yeah, I promise you. I'll never forget you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.67,0:23:19.69,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,This is, like, no fair! Making a girl cry...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.58,0:23:26.84,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Just go! Scram already! Shoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.19,0:23:31.43,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,SQ...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.27,0:23:41.10,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,No! Stay here with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.70,0:23:43.28,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Yuri...
